      }</script><style type="text/css" id="jam_theme">:root{--itchio_ui_bg: #282828;}body{background-color: #000000;}.jam_page_wrap{color: #ffffff;background-color: #000000;font-family: Lato,Lato,LatoExtended,sans-serif;font-size: 100%;--itchio_border_radius: initial;--itchio_link_color: #6ec1e4;--itchio_border_color: #261836;--itchio_button_color: #6ec1e4;--itchio_button_fg_color: #16262d;--itchio_button_shadow_color: #54a7ca;--itchio_button_border_color: #54a7ca;--itchio_button_hover_color: #65b8db;--itchio_button_active_color: #72c5e8;background-image: url('https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3NzYwMTMwLnBuZw==/original/uwRg9J.png'); background-repeat: repeat; background-position: 50% 0%; background-attachment: fixed}.jam_body{border-radius: var(--itchio_border_radius,0);}.view_jam_page h1,.view_jam_page h2,.view_jam_page h3,.view_jam_page h4,.view_jam_page h5,.view_jam_page h6{}.view_jam_page .jam_body,.view_jam_page .grid_outer{background-color: rgba(14, 0, 30, 1);}.view_jam_page .jam_body{box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px transparent;}.view_jam_page .grid_outer .itch_footer{border-top: 1px solid #312341 !important;background-color: #261836;}.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_text,.view_jam_page .grid_outer .game_count,.view_jam_page .grid_outer .footer_submissions{color: #a294b2 !important;}.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_platform,.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_genre,.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_author a,.view_jam_page .grid_outer .powerd_by{color: #7d6f8d !important;}.view_jam_page .header_tabs .community_activity{background-color: #261836;color: #ffffff;}.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .filter_item{color: #7d6f8d !important;}.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .filter_item:hover,.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .filter_item.active{color: #a294b2 !important;border-color: #6ec1e4 !important;}.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .divider{color: #a294b2;} </style></head><body class="locale_en jam_layout_widget layout_widget responsive no_theme_toggle" data-host="itch.io" data-page_name="view_jam"><div class="gray jam_layout_header_widget header_widget base_widget small_logo" id="jam_layout_header_8618558"><a href="#maincontent" class="skip_to_main">Skip to main content</a><div class="primary_header"><h1 title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" class="title"><a title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" class="header_logo" href="/"><span class="visually_hidden">itch.io</span><img class="full_logo" width="775" src="https://static.itch.io/images/logo-black-new.svg" height="199" alt="itch.io logo &amp; title"/><img class="minimal_logo" width="262" src="https://static.itch.io/images/itchio-textless-black.svg" height="235" alt="itch.io logo"/></a></h1><div class="header_buttons"><a data-label="browse" class="header_button browse_btn" href="/games">Browse Games</a><a data-label="jams" class="header_button jams_btn" href="/jams">Game Jams</a><a data-label="developers" class="header_button developers_btn" href="/developers"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-upload"></span>Upload Game</a><a data-label="devlogs" class="header_button devlogs_btn" href="/devlogs">Developer Logs</a><a data-label="community.home" class="header_button community.home_btn" href="/community">Community</a></div><form action="/search" class="game_search"><input class="search_input" type="text" name="q" placeholder="Search for games, jams, tags or creators" required="required"/><button aria-label="Search" class="submit_btn"><svg stroke-linecap="round" class="svgicon icon_search" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden role="img" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" version="1.1"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_4771865"><a data-label="log_in" class="panel_button" href="/login" data-register_action="header">Log in</a><a data-label="register" class="panel_button register_button" href="/register" data-register_action="header">Register</a></div></div><div class="header_dropdown" data-target="browse"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default after_voting is_over has_banner" id="view_jam_7855440"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3NzYwMTMxLnBuZw==/original/Rlb12O.png" class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_6495866"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam">Toasty Jam 2 - RPG Maker Game Jam</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://toastytime.itch.io">Toasty</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/toastyjam">#toastyjam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam/entries"><div class="stat_value">75</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">1,002</div><div class="stat_label">Ratings</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active" href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam">Overview</a><a data-label="tab_view_jam_entries" class="header_tab" href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam/entries">Submissions</a><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam/results">Results</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">21</span></div><a data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab" href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam/feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget after_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_9174344"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-06 16:00:00</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-13 07:10:00</span>. <a href="/jam/toasty-jam-2-rpg-maker-game-jam/results">View results</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h1 class="text-center"><em><div><iframe allowfullscreen="" frameborder="0" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/Z_LLH6zo_bU" height="281" width="500"></iframe></div>Challenge yourself to create an RPG Maker (or similar) game in 1 WEEK!&nbsp;Top 20 games streamed by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Toastyfunnyguy" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">ToastyTime</a> with&nbsp;$100 in prizes!</em></h1>
<h1>PRIZES</h1>
<p><strong>1st place:</strong> $50
</p>
<p><strong>2nd place: </strong>$30
</p>
<p><strong>3rd place: </strong>$20</p>
<p>The <strong>top 20</strong> entries as ranked by the community&nbsp;+ other entries that catch Toasty&#x27;s eye but may have been rated low, will be livestreamed by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Toastyfunnyguy" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">ToastyTime</a>! A&nbsp;YouTube video will also be made covering the entire event.</p>
<h1>THEME</h1>
<p><strong><strong>The theme is: </strong><span><span><span>Underground</span></span></span>&nbsp;(Inspired by&nbsp;my game <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3616480/Grimdelve/" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Grimdelve</a>&nbsp;underground setting)</strong></p>
<p><strong>Some examples:&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Like in my game Grimdelve, it could be a normal RPG with towns and quests and adventure, just set entirely underground! What constraints might arise from this setting&hellip;?&nbsp;
</p>
<p>The characters live above ground, but must descend into a cave to gather resources and do trade. I’m imagining something like Moonlighter for this.&nbsp;
</p>
<p>A character is trapped underground and must find a way to escape to the above ground. Perhaps each day, the underground could shift to a different layout.&nbsp;
</p>
<p>Enemies are invading the underground and you must defend it because it is your home because you are a worm. Or an ant. But no spiders because Ms. Toasty hates spiders&hellip;</p>
<p>Adherence to the theme will be one of 4 voting criteria and is something ToastyTime will consider in his final decision (see&nbsp;<em>Voting</em> in <em>Rules&nbsp;</em>for more).</p>
<h1>
RULES</h1>
<p>-<strong>ENGINE:</strong> Your game should be made in <strong>RPG Maker</strong>, or similar engines that curate the RPG Maker experience and vibe. Engines like <strong>Wolf RPG Editor, RPG Paper Maker, RPG Bakin, Smile Game Builder, EasyRPG, and MKXP-Z</strong> are allowed. If your engine of choice is not listed, feel free to ask in our discord or on the community page! Chances are, so long as you stick to the &quot;RPG Maker Vibe&quot; that it will be allowed!</p>
<p>-<strong>ORIGINAL WORK:</strong> Development on contest entries <strong>must begin after the jam starts</strong>. Pre-existing assets (such as music, sound effects, and graphical resources) <strong>may be used</strong>, but any new content made for the game must be created <strong>during the jam period</strong>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>-<strong>TEAM SIZE:</strong> Teams should <strong>not be larger than 5</strong> in order to keep this fair for devs of all sizes.<strong> Only one submission per person. </strong>Artists or other collaborators can work on multiple games, but only if creating distinct assets for each one. Only one person needs to join itch.io and submit the game. However, if others on the team also join itch.io, they can be tagged as contributors. (On your game&#x27;s itch page, pick &quot;Edit&quot;, &quot;More&quot;, &quot;Admins&quot;, and follow the instructions).&nbsp;
</p>
<p>-<strong>GENERATIVE AI:</strong> You <strong>MAY NOT&nbsp;</strong>use generative AI in this jam to create graphical resources, but you <strong>MAY</strong> use AI to help with&nbsp;coding or brainstorming. Last jam I allowed AI art, but this is no longer the case.&nbsp;Any entries that use generative AI for graphical resources&nbsp;will be found and will not be eligible to win. Join our Discord and collaborate with a community member for your art!</p>
<p>-<strong>YOUR GAME:</strong> Your entry must be playable by someone using a Windows PC, with nothing more than a keyboard or mouse. Game uploads will be locked during the voting stage and <strong>NO</strong> changes may be made until after this period ends.
</p>
<p>-<strong>ADULT GAMES: </strong>You <strong>MAY</strong> create games featuring <strong>ADULT CONTENT</strong>, however you&nbsp;<strong>MUST offer a censored mode that hides all nudity </strong>and you&nbsp;<strong>MUST </strong>disclose this on the submission page and <strong>follow the Itch.io Terms of Service (<a href="https://itch.io/docs/legal/terms">https://itch.io/docs/legal/terms</a>).</strong></p>
<p>-<strong>VOTING:</strong>&nbsp;All members of the general public are able to play and rate entries along the 4 public criteria: <em>Adherence to Theme, Enjoyment, Creativity, and Presentation</em>. These ratings will help narrow down the list of games played by ToastyTime. To ensure a fair and high-quality showcase, ToastyTime reserves the right to curate the final list of streamed entries, particularly in cases of suspected rating manipulation or to highlight hidden gems that deserve a spotlight.&nbsp;<strong>ONLY the&nbsp;</strong><strong>Toasty Rank&nbsp;criteria, given manually by ToastyTime, counts for prizes.</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<h1>ABOUT</h1>
<p>ToastyTime is an RPG Maker YouTuber who has been covering RPG Maker games since 2017. He will be playing up to an hour of <strong>THE TOP 20</strong>&nbsp;jam entries&nbsp;+ other entries that catch his eye but may have rated low in a livestream and will create a video covering the event. Videos will appear on the ToastyTime YouTube channel (<a href="https://www.youtube.com/toastyfunnyguy" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">https://www.youtube.com/toastyfunnyguy</a>).</p>
<p>
<em>To discuss the jam and keep up to date with information, <a target="_blank" href="https://discord.gg/CQyS4FZ" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">join the discord</a>:</em>
</p>
